# Open Tick — core

Local-first Electron task app (TickTick API sync). Stack: Electron main + React renderer + SQLite (`better-sqlite3`).

## Layout

- `electron/main/` — main process, DB, sync, IPC handlers, notifications
- `electron/preload/` — bridge only
- `shared/` — types and pure helpers shared by main + renderer (`@shared/*`)
- `src/` — React UI
- `tests/unit/` — Vitest (Node ABI, not Electron)

## Agent defaults

- Do **not** commit or push unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer extending existing repositories, IPC channels, and hooks over new parallel systems.
- Types used by the renderer from `shared/` must be **exported** (re-export `export type { Foo }` if declared locally) — missing exports break `tsc` in CI.
- Product copy in UI/errors and tests must stay in sync (e.g. inbox is a “list”, not “project”).
- Keep changes scoped; no drive-by refactors or unsolicited markdown docs.
